   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat obtenu jusqu&#x2019;en mars 2024 est une meilleure compr&#xe9;hension, par les participants du minist&#xe8;re de la D&#xe9;fense nationale, de la mani&#xe8;re de mener efficacement des enqu&#xea;tes sur le terrorisme biologique international.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Result achieved as of March 2024 includes increased understanding by Department of National Defence participant of how to effectively conduct international biological terrorism investigations.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet est le renforcement de capacit&#xe9;s internationales visant &#xe0; pr&#xe9;venir la prolif&#xe9;ration des armes biologiques et le terrorisme, gr&#xe2;ce au partage des connaissances et au renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project includes enhanced international capabilities to prevent biological weapons proliferation and terrorism through knowledge sharing and capacity building.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
